          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अनुसन्धानम् (anusandhānam) is built on anu, sam and the root √dhā, \"to put\"; MW gives anu-saṃdhāna \"investigation, inquiry, searching into, close inspection\" (MW)."
